===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*kridlo}}. ''Ы'' probably appeared by the influence of {{m|ru|крыть}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|крыло́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-крыло.ogg}}

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|d|крыло́|-ья|or|b|pltail=*|notes=* Poetic.|dim=кры́лышко|adj=крыльево́й}}

# [[wing]]
#: {{coi|ru|[[разма́х '''кры́льев''']]|[[wingspan|'''wing'''span]], [[wingspread|'''wing'''spread]]}}
## {{lb|ru|aviation|engineering}} a pair of [[wing]]s {{q|viewed as a single aerodynamic entity}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[правый|пра́вая]] [[полупло́скость]] '''крыла́'''|starboard '''wing'''|lit=the right half-plane of the wing}}
# [[sail]] {{q|of a windmill}}
# [[fender]], [[wing]] {{q|panel of a car that encloses the wheel area}}
# [[fender]], [[mudguard]] {{q|cover over a bicycle or motorcycle wheel}}
# {{lb|ru|politics}} [[wing]], [[faction]]
# {{lb|ru|bodybuilding|slang|usually|in the plural}} a [[lat]] or particularly a [[widely]] [[sculpted]] [[latissimus dorsi]] [[muscle]].
# {{lb|ru|military slang}} [[fixed-wing]] [[drone]]

